es: any string was\ndeduplicated, sorted and stored verbatim. An unknown scope satisfies no\nrequirement in scope.Grants, so such a client is silently minted with\nfewer permissions than the operator asked for.\n\nValidate scopes against scope.Known() in CreateOAuthClient, alongside the\nexisting tag validation, and map the error to 400 so it surfaces the same\nway an invalid tag does.\n\nFixes #3406","parents":[{"sha":"f227d68781a1777c41f16036f4260b27f01ab014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f227d68781a1777c41f16036f4260b27f01ab014","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f227d68781a1777c41f16036f4260b27f01ab014"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"538826dd8ffcf9c39bfe33c9d40538ffba13217b","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDUzODgyNmRkOGZmY2Y5YzM5YmZlMzNjOWQ0MDUzOGZmYmExMzIxN2I","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/538826dd8ffcf9c39bfe33c9d40538ffba13217b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/538826dd8ffcf9c39bfe33c9d40538ffba13217b","author":{"name":"MsfPablo","email":"pablogarciacaceres5@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-02T15:37:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-09-25T12:50:15Z"},"tree":{"sha":"3ee00dd480df916cf410fd93551c3830bfffcef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/3ee00dd480df916cf410fd93551c3830bfffcef4"},"message":"Report every invalid scope at once and keep validation separate from normalisation","parents":[{"sha":"77e8987879c5c615f812572c4f0d2941852004e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/77e8987879c5c615f812572c4f0d2941852004e8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/77e8987879c5c615f812572c4f0d2941852004e8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"